WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
But wine vessels from the Shang Dynasty are becoming increasingly rare.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I saw this thing at an auction ten years ago

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
But that one is quite well preserved.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Finally sold for 10 million

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This horse is not well preserved

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The value is greatly reduced

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
There are varying degrees of cracks inside the wine vessel

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Now I estimate it is only worth three to four million.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
It’s still very good as a collection.

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Three to four million brothers

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,000
You are really my lucky star

12
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
It turned out to be a wine vessel from the Shang Dynasty

13
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This is the old man’s birthday party

14
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
I can finally give an explanation.

15
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Professor Qiu just said this stuff

16
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Probably between three million and four million

17
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
How about I give out four million medicines?

18
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Brother Pei

19
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
This is my family heirloom.

20
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Since you like it so much

21
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Then I'll bear the pain and let it go. It's a good deal.
